      "outputTokens": 670,
      "costUsd": 0.006075,
      "pronunciationText": "Let's use the formula. The sequence is three, six, twelve, and so on. Find the eighth term. First, ay is three, and r is six over three, which is two. The eighth term is seven multiplications from the first, so it's three, times two to the power seven. Two to the seven is one hundred and twenty-eight, so the eighth term is three hundred and eighty-four."
